\n\n3. The development of the first AI system capable of playing chess and other games, Deep Blue, in 1997.\n\n4. The development of the first AI system capable of playing Go, AlphaGo, in 2015.\n\n5. The development of the first AI system capable of playing poker, DeepMind's AlphaGo, in 2013.\n\n6. The development of the first AI system capable of understanding natural language, DeepMind's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n7. The development of the first AI system capable of generating human-like speech, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n8. The development of the first AI system capable of learning from human feedback, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n9. The development of the first AI system capable of generating human-like emotions, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n10. The development of the first AI system capable of generating human-like conversations, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n11. The development of the first AI system capable of understanding and responding to human emotions, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n12. The development of the first AI system capable of understanding and responding to human language, OpenAI's GPT-3, in 2020.\n\n13. The development of the first AI system capable", "counters": {"block_fetch_calls": 4, "block_blocks": 89, "chunk_merges": 0}, "runs": [{"time_s": 24.251583337783813, "tpot_ms": 47.36637370660901, "new_tokens": 512, "counters": {"block_fetch_calls": 4, "block_blocks": 89, "chunk_merges": 0}, "mem": {"peak_total": 98, "peak_gpu": 66, "peak_cpu": 64, "steps": 512, "sum_gpu": 2528, "sum_cpu": 89}, "timing": {"sched.score": {"total_ms": 1.5367185696959496, "calls": 4, "max_ms": 0.4791896790266037}, "sched.offload": {"total_ms": 42.67462249845266, "calls": 4, "max_ms": 22.359534166753292}, "build.patch": {"total_ms": 111.67407687753439, "calls": 511, "max_ms": 2.0007919520139694}, "pq.append": {"total_ms": 5982.450948096812, "calls": 11242, "max_ms": 2.1421900019049644}, "pq.luts": {"total_ms": 1481.9589536637068, "calls": 11242, "max_ms": 0.5920547991991043}, "pq